13 s8dddea077 s4e0702b73 s86843cf1e sd6b7ed772 sc78facc7a s4bee8b56f s621cdb68b sf5691251b sb91be1d34 s29bbbc92d" data-node-id="145:7743"><p class="sa0118ea47">Diet friendly and delicious!</p></div></div><div class="s1deb79dbb sc9dfef269 s08b04966c sd89972fe1 s012fbd121 s6da6a3c3f" data-node-id="145:7744" data-name="Container"><div class="s36b381be4 s0f92246ac sda4dbfbc4 s60fbb7713 s8dddea077 sdb8eaeca8 s8ecebc9f8 s86843cf1e sd6b7ed772 sc78facc7a s4d2392e8e sd2a412c3b sf55a94416 sed2990e87" data-node-id="145:7745"><p class="s2e527ec2d s5a4fd449f">Im onto my 2nd bag and this has been one of the best breakfast substitutes for my busy chef life. I mostly always skip breakfast when im working, but always</p><p class="s2e527ec2d s5a4fd449f">have coffee. So this, kills 2 birds with one stone. On top of being on a diet using my Slendriiz drops and body balance system. I drink 2 scoops with water only</p><p class="s2e527ec2d s5a4fd449f">about 12-14oz and I love it. Way better then my old Starbucks routines. If I need an extra pep in my step i add some black coffee my job has (8oz water, 4oz</p><p class="s2e527ec2d">black coffee) shake it up in my Jaavy Shaker bottle and im set for the day!</p></div></div><button type="button" class="s507c28c0b s60fbb7713 s8dddea077 s60541e1e2 s86843cf1e sd89972fe1 s012fbd121 s6da6a3c3f" data-node-id="145:7746" data-name="Button" aria-label="Read More"><div class="s507c28c0b s60fbb7713 s60541e1e2 sd89972fe1 s012fbd121 s6da6a3c3f" data-node-id="145:7747" data-name="Container"><div class="s0f92246ac s60fbb7713 s8dddea077 sdb8eaeca8 s8ecebc9f8 s86843cf1e sd6b7ed772 sd89972fe1 s012fbd121 s4d2392e8e sd2a412c3b se82ae8be0" data-node-id="145:7748"><p class="s2e527ec2d">Read More</p></div></div></button></div><div class="s507c28c0b s60fbb7713 s3960ffc24 s731b2bef9 s8071008a7 sd89972fe1 s012fbd121 s6da6a3c3f" data-node-id="145:7749" data-name="Container"><div class="s507c28c0b s60fbb7713 s8dddea077 s60541e1e2 sd89972fe1 s012fbd121" data-node-id="145: